WEBVTT

00:27:29.246 --> 00:27:33.329
Five years ago, it was every blue collar
job is up for destruction,

00:27:33.788 --> 00:27:35.246
maybe like last year it was.

00:27:35.246 --> 00:27:39.579
Every creative job is up for destruction
because of things like Jukebox I.

00:27:41.996 --> 00:27:44.246
I think there will be an
enormous impact on.

00:27:46.788 --> 00:27:48.913
The job market, and I really hate it,

00:27:49.371 --> 00:27:51.746
I think it's kind of gross when
people like working on

00:27:51.788 --> 00:27:54.538
I pretend like there's not going
to be or sort of say, oh,

00:27:54.538 --> 00:27:56.579
don't worry about it. It'll
just all obviously better.

00:27:56.579 --> 00:28:01.121
It doesn't always obviously get better.
I think what is true is.